<title>POLAND: Bourse fines Espebepe Rafako.</title>
<headline>Bourse fines Espebepe Rafako.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Warsaw bourse's court placed small fines on construction firm Espebepe SA and industrial boiler maker Rafako SA after they drastically revised down 1995 earnings figures last year, the bourse's deputy president said.</p>
<p>PAP news agency quoted Ryszard Czerniawski as saying on Friday that the bourse fined Espebepe 15,000 zlotys and Rafako 13,000 zlotys.</p>
<p>Last year Espebepe revised down its 1995 net loss by about 10 times to 17.9 million zlotys.</p>
<p>Rafako revised down a 16.8-million-zloty net profit to a 56.4-million-zloty loss.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
